  message: "Fixed in PR #2347 (e0a8f4c52). On dev 49bc5c6e4: a Phoenix channel fixture (lib/app_web/channels/room_channel.ex) yields elixir:lib/app_web/channels/room_channel.ex:7-7:phoenix.send.new_msg:function with discovery_language elixir (None when reviewed on 2026-11-01); an openapi.yaml yields operation nodes with discovery_language yaml; 0 violations on both. The gate's allowed set of language_from_path callers shrank to {_text_filters, websocket, subprocess_cli}. Decision taken on the item's open question: spec-file nodes take the taxonomy's yaml / json; the owner can overturn it. NOT changed: the item's third row, subprocess_cli, still labels through the grammar map (the value is python and correct today); it is listed in WI-honit-surof-pitok-bijiz-jubah-raguz-fobuz-jiboz. Outputs: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/idfive_11232026/closure/ (fixtures*.txt, trees_summary.txt, pair_check_dev.txt)."  # 9718
